PKG=TTYCITY
NAME=ttycity - Micropolis for curses terminals
ARCH=m68k
CATEGORY=application
VENDOR=tenox7; SVR4 port github.com/slaapliedje/asv-games
DESC=ttycity, tenox7's terminal port of Micropolis, as a static AMIX program. Colour needs TERM=xterm-color (the entry is installed with the package). On Atari System V it needs the service pack's amx module.
